            "a": "(i) x^3 + [[1/x^3]] = (x + [[1/x]])^3 − 3(x)([[1/x]])(x + [[1/x]])\n= (6)^3 − 3(6)\n= 216 − 18\n= 198\n(ii) x^3 + [[1/x^3]] = (x + [[1/x]])^3 − 3(x + [[1/x]])\n= (−5)^3 − 3(−5)\n= −125 + 15\n= −110\n(iii) x^3 + [[1/x^3]] = (x + [[1/x]])^3 − 3(x + [[1/x]])\n= ([[1/2]])^3 − 3([[1/2]])\n= [[1/8]] − [[3/2]]\n= −1 [[3/8]]\n(iv) x^3 + [[1/x^3]] = (x + [[1/x]])^3 − 3(x + [[1/x]])\n= (10.1)^3 − 3(10.1)\n= 1030.301 − 30.3\n= 1000.001"
