            "q": "قائمۃ الزاویہ مثلث ABC میں زاویہ C قائمہ ہے اگر m∠A = x اور m∠B = y تو ثابت کیجئے کہ:\n(i) Sin x = Cos y (ii) Tan y = Cot x (iii) Sec x = Cosec y (iv) Cos x = Sin y (v) Cot y = Tan x (vi) Cosec x = Sec y\n(شکل: m∠C = 90°، a = m BC = 30 cm، b = m AC = 16 cm، c = m AB = 34 cm)",
            "a": "(i) Sin x = [[m BC/m AB]] = [[a/c]] = [[30/34]] = [[15/17]]\nCos y = [[m BC/m AB]] = [[a/c]] = [[30/34]] = [[15/17]]\nپس Sin x = Cos y\n(ii) Tan y = [[m AC/m BC]] = [[b/a]] = [[16/30]] = [[8/15]]\nCot x = [[m AC/m BC]] = [[b/a]] = [[16/30]] = [[8/15]]\nپس Tan y = Cot x\n(iii) Sec x = [[m AB/m AC]] = [[c/b]] = [[34/16]] = [[17/8]]\nCosec y = [[m AB/m AC]] = [[c/b]] = [[34/16]] = [[17/8]]\nپس Sec x = Cosec y\n(iv) Cos x = [[m AC/m AB]] = [[b/c]] = [[16/34]] = [[8/17]]\nSin y = [[m AC/m AB]] = [[b/c]] = [[16/34]] = [[8/17]]\nپس Cos x = Sin y\n(v) Cot y = [[m BC/m AC]] = [[a/b]] = [[30/16]] = [[15/8]]\nTan x = [[m BC/m AC]] = [[a/b]] = [[30/16]] = [[15/8]]\nپس Cot y = Tan x\n(vi) Cosec x = [[m AB/m BC]] = [[c/a]] = [[34/30]] = [[17/15]]\nSec y = [[m AB/m BC]] = [[c/a]] = [[34/30]] = [[17/15]]\nپس Cosec x = Sec y"
